# González White 2019 (Colombia BanRep notes)

When identifying, dating, or stating printage for a **Banco de la República** note (1923–2019), read `docs/sources/gonzalez-white/README.md` and search `docs/sources/gonzalez-white/catalogo-billetes-banrep-2019-7ed.txt`, then confirm the row in the PDF.

Cite **BG#** and the page. Use that row’s emisión, series, digit count, printer, and replacement flag. Do not republish `ESTIMADO $` or plates.

Replacements (`asterisco`, `R`, `estrella`) are their own BG# rows. BanRep year totals in `docs/sources/banrep/` are not a substitute for a BG# emisión.

This book does not list banca libre / Banco Nacional / independence paper — do not look those up here.

Do not link the repo PDF on the public site.
